msgid ""
"要先关掉一个 Windows 开关：\n"
"• 按下面「打开登录选项」（设置 → 帐户 → 登录选项）\n"
"• Windows 11：拉到最下面「其他设置」，关掉「为了提高安全性，仅允许对此设备上的 Microsoft 帐户使用 Windows Hello 登录(推荐)」\n"
"• Windows 10：关掉「需要 Windows Hello 登录 Microsoft 帐户」\n"
"• 开关是灰的：先到 account.microsoft.com →「安全」→「高级安全选项」关掉「无密码帐户」，重新开机再关\n"
"• 关好后再按一次这个按钮"
msgstr ""
"Turn off one Windows switch first:\n"
"• Press \"Open sign-in options\" below (Settings → Accounts → Sign-in options)\n"
"• Windows 11: scroll to \"Additional settings\" at the bottom and turn off \"For improved security, only allow Windows Hello sign-in for Microsoft accounts on this device (Recommended)\"\n"
"• Windows 10: turn off \"Require Windows Hello sign-in for Microsoft accounts\"\n"
"• Switch greyed out: first go to account.microsoft.com → \"Security\" → \"Advanced security options\", turn off \"Passwordless account\", restart, then turn it off\n"
"• Then press this button again"
